- "Trying to determine the best form of shoe to get our 11 month old baby for beginning to walk. I know that there are some discussions between flat feet prevention (something that both baby's mother and I slightly suffer from) and ensuring sensory feedback with the ground. I want to make sure that baby is building a connection and spatial awareness with the ground." [sr122-0045]
