8 of 122 posts.

Parents ask for sensory books at five months, reading choices at four and seven months, and books enjoyed by toddlers under two. Other requests concern an inscribable birthday book, a personalized dad-and-daughter story, preparing for a sibling, and learning how to parent the approaching toddler years.

- "I haven’t been able to find any that I think are any good at my towns bookstores so I’d like to order one online but they never really show me what’s in them. Has anybody else found any they really like? I’d like one that has several different materials and textures, something different than the ones of fake animal skin that all feel like tissue paper or something" [sr009-0062]
